@everyone since y'all decided to make 1500 goodberries for this fight to exploit the house rule that you can eat more than 1, lol (actually really good thinking so I don't want to completely punish it)
You can feed someone/consume up to a max of  🔟 berries at once using your action.

Stuffing a berry in your mouth is fine, but chewing still requires yours or someone else's action

